{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37150","headline":"致孙状元诉醵罚钱 · 卢嗣业","name":"致孙状元诉醵罚钱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未识都君面，频输复分钱。\n苦心事笔砚，得志助花钿。\n徒步求秋赋，持杯给暮饘。\n力微多谢病，非不奉同年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢嗣业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}